@startuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
autonumber

box "AuRORA Manager Shim (tu v4)" #LightGreen
participant "Manager Core\n(inst_q depth=4, forward RoCCCommand)" as Mgr_Core
participant "MMU Subsystem\n(PTW + optional L2TLB/PTECache,\ndefault OFF - day la TANG 2 cua TLB)" as Mgr_MMU
end box

box "Gemmini (LazyRoCC, gan vao Manager qua genRoCC)" #Khaki
participant "io.cmd Queue\n(raw_cmd, depth=2)" as G_RawCmd
participant "LoopUnroller /\nLoopMatmul / LoopConv" as G_Loop
participant "Reservation Station\n(3 hang doi: ld_q/ex_q/st_q\n+ deps_ld/ex/st bitvector)" as G_RS
participant "Load Controller" as G_Load
participant "Store Controller" as G_Store
participant "Ex Controller\n(Mesh / PE systolic array)" as G_Ex
participant "FrontendTLB (L1)\n(tlb_size entries, per Load/Store client)" as G_TLB1
participant "DMA\n(XactTracker + BeatPacker,\nmulti-outstanding qua TileLink)" as G_DMA
participant "Scratchpad / Accumulator\n(SRAM banks)" as G_SPAD
end box

== 0. Ghi chu kien truc (khac v4 gia dinh ban dau) ==
note over Mgr_Core, G_SPAD
  Gemmini KHONG phai 1 FIFO don thuc thi tuan tu. No la 1 scoreboard
  thuc su: lenh vao chung 1 io.cmd, nhung ROB (Reservation Station)
  tach ra 3 hang doi song song (load/store/execute), moi lenh moi
  duoc issue khi cac bit "deps" (tinh tu chong lan dia chi scratchpad/
  accumulator luc alloc) da duoc xoa boi cac lenh phu thuoc hoan tat.
  Thu tu THUC THI co the KHAC thu tu Manager forward lenh vao,
  mien la khong vi pham RAW/WAW hazard tren dia chi local (spad/acc).

  Gemmini co 2 TANG TLB: FrontendTLB (L1, nho, rieng cho Gemmini,
  tlb_size mac dinh nho) -> khi miss moi di len PTW/L2TLB cua Manager
  (mac dinh OFF, xem review doc muc 1.2). Day la ly do "tlb_size=4"
  (Gemmini/GemminiConfigs.scala) va "l2TLBEntries" (rerocc/Manager)
  la 2 khoi HOAN TOAN khac nhau, KHONG mau thuan nhau.

  Gemmini chi tra ve io.resp (writeback rd) cho DUY NHAT 1 loai lenh:
  COUNTER_OP (doc counter, funct=126). Moi lenh mvin/mvout/preload/
  compute/loop_ws/loop_conv/flush KHONG BAO GIO tao io.resp - hoan
  tat duoc theo doi noi bo qua io.busy, KHONG co ack rieng tung lenh
  tra ve Manager. => sWrite (2-beat) trong v4 CHI xay ra khi funct
  la COUNTER_OP; con lai Manager chi biet "xong" qua io.busy=0.
end note

== 1. Manager forward RoCCCommand vao Gemmini (tiep noi buoc 5, v4) ==
Mgr_Core -> G_RawCmd : io.cmd.valid <= RoCCCommand (tu inst_q cua Manager)
activate G_RawCmd
G_RawCmd -> G_RawCmd : raw_cmd_q (Queue depth=2), tach song song:\n- CISC funct -> cmd_fsm/tiler (bo qua o day, gia su RISC-V mode)\n- RISC-V funct -> raw_risc_cmd

alt funct == CLKGATE_EN
    G_RawCmd -> G_RawCmd : clock_en_reg := rs1(0) (bat/tat clock-gate,\nxu ly rieng, khong vao RS)
else funct thuoc LOOP_WS*/LOOP_CONV_WS*
    G_RawCmd -> G_Loop : LoopMatmul / LoopConv nhan mega-instruction
    activate G_Loop
    G_Loop -> G_Loop : Unroll thanh chuoi lenh nguyen thuy\n(mvin/mvin2/mvin3, preload, compute_and_flip/stay)\ndua tren reservation_station.io.*_completed de dieu tiet toc do unroll
    G_Loop --> G_RS : Phat lenh nguyen thuy da unroll, tuan tu
    deactivate G_Loop
else funct la lenh nguyen thuy (CONFIG/LOAD*/STORE/COMPUTE*/PRELOAD/FLUSH)
    G_RawCmd -> G_RS : Forward truc tiep (khong qua Loop Unroller)
end
deactivate G_RawCmd

== 2. Reservation Station: alloc + tinh dependency (RAW/WAW tren dia chi local) ==
activate G_RS
G_RS -> G_RS : io.alloc: doc dia chi scratchpad/accumulator lien quan\n(vd dia chi dich cua LOAD, dia chi nguon cua COMPUTE/STORE)
G_RS -> G_RS : Tinh deps_ld/deps_ex/deps_st (bitvector) so voi\ncac entry DANG TON TAI trong ca 3 hang doi (chong lan dia chi)
G_RS -> G_RS : new_entry.valid := true ; push vao 1-trong-3\nhang doi noi bo (ld_q / ex_q / st_q) theo funct

note over G_RS
  Neu ca 3 hang doi (ld/ex/st) da day (reservation_station_entries_ld/ex/st,
  gioi han rieng tung loai) -> io.alloc.ready = false -> raw_cmd_q phia
  truoc bi stall -> LAN NGUOC len Manager.inst_q -> co the day nguoc
  toi cfg_credits phia Client (v4 buoc 4) khi inst_q Manager day.
end note

== 3. Issue tu Reservation Station toi 3 Controller (co the out-of-order giua cac loai) ==
alt entry o ld_q, deps_ld rong (khong con phu thuoc)
    G_RS -> G_Load : io.issue.ld: forward RoCCCommand (mvin/mvin2/mvin3)
    activate G_Load
else entry o ex_q, deps_ex rong
    G_RS -> G_Ex : io.issue.ex: forward RoCCCommand (compute/preload/config_ex)
    activate G_Ex
else entry o st_q, deps_st rong
    G_RS -> G_Store : io.issue.st: forward RoCCCommand (mvout/config_store)
    activate G_Store
end
deactivate G_RS

== 4. Load path: DMA doc tu memory he thong vao Scratchpad/Accumulator ==
G_Load -> G_DMA : Yeu cau doc (VA, so hang/cot, local_addr dich)
activate G_DMA
G_DMA -> G_TLB1 : Translate VA -> PA (L1, per-client)
activate G_TLB1
alt L1 TLB hit
    G_TLB1 --> G_DMA : PA (nhanh, khong round-trip Manager)
else L1 TLB miss
    G_TLB1 -> Mgr_MMU : io.ptw request (PTW walk, qua L2TLB/PTECache\nneu duoc bat, mac dinh OFF -> walk thang tu page table)
    activate Mgr_MMU
    Mgr_MMU --> G_TLB1 : PA + permission bits
    deactivate Mgr_MMU
    G_TLB1 --> G_DMA : PA (cache lai vao L1 cho lan sau)
end
deactivate G_TLB1

G_DMA -> G_DMA : XactTracker gan source-id (toi da num_ids=32\nyeu cau outstanding song song qua TileLink)
G_DMA -> G_DMA : Phat TileLink Get(s) toi he thong bo nho\n(qua Manager's tlNode / SoC Interconnect)
G_DMA -> G_DMA : BeatPacker gom cac beat tra ve thanh 1 dong du lieu day du
G_DMA --> G_Load : Data + local_addr + is_acc + accumulate flags
deactivate G_DMA
G_Load -> G_SPAD : Ghi vao Scratchpad hoac Accumulator bank\n(cong don neu accumulate=true)
activate G_SPAD
G_SPAD --> G_Load : Write done
deactivate G_SPAD
G_Load -> G_RS : io.completed(queue=ld, issue_id)
deactivate G_Load

== 5. Execute path: Mesh systolic array doc/ghi Scratchpad+Accumulator ==
G_Ex -> G_SPAD : Doc toan hang A/B tu Scratchpad theo local_addr\n(preload weight neu la PRELOAD_CMD)
activate G_SPAD
G_SPAD --> G_Ex : Du lieu operand
deactivate G_SPAD
G_Ex -> G_Ex : Systolic array (Mesh/PE) thuc hien MAC qua nhieu chu ky\n(weight-stationary dataflow, so chu ky ~ O(rows+cols+tileRows/Cols))
G_Ex -> G_SPAD : Ghi ket qua vao Accumulator bank (cong don theo cau hinh)
activate G_SPAD
G_SPAD --> G_Ex : Write done
deactivate G_SPAD
G_Ex -> G_RS : io.completed(queue=ex, issue_id)
deactivate G_Ex

== 6. Store path: DMA ghi tu Scratchpad/Accumulator ra memory he thong ==
G_Store -> G_SPAD : Doc du lieu tu local_addr (Scratchpad/Accumulator)\n(co the ap dung Activation/Scale/Pooling neu mvout tu Accumulator)
activate G_SPAD
G_SPAD --> G_Store : Data
deactivate G_SPAD
G_Store -> G_DMA : Yeu cau ghi (VA dich, data)
activate G_DMA
G_DMA -> G_TLB1 : Translate VA -> PA (L1, tuong tu buoc 4)
G_TLB1 --> G_DMA : PA
G_DMA -> G_DMA : XactTracker gan source-id, phat TileLink Put(s)
G_DMA --> G_Store : Write ack (TileLink D-channel, "writes khong ack\nchi tiet du lieu trong Gemmini theo comment RTL")
deactivate G_DMA
G_Store -> G_RS : io.completed(queue=st, issue_id)
deactivate G_Store

== 7. Reservation Station xoa dependency, cho phep cac lenh dang cho issue ==
activate G_RS
G_RS -> G_RS : Xoa bit tuong ung trong deps_ld/deps_ex/deps_st\ncua MOI entry con lai dang tham chieu issue_id vua hoan tat
G_RS -> G_RS : Cac entry vua het deps -> san sang issue (quay lai buoc 3)
deactivate G_RS

== 8. FLUSH_CMD (rieng, khong qua Reservation Station thong thuong) ==
G_RawCmd -> G_TLB1 : funct==FLUSH_CMD -> tlb.io.exp.flush()\n(xoa SACH FrontendTLB noi bo cua Gemmini - TANG 1)
note over G_TLB1
  Luu y: day la flush TANG 1 (Gemmini tu lam), HOAN TOAN khac
  voi SFENCE o Manager (v4 buoc 8, xoa TANG 2 - L2TLB/PTECode
  cua rerocc Manager) khi rerocc_release. Hai co che doc lap,
  phai mo hinh CA HAI trong gem5, khong duoc gop lam mot.
end note

== 9. io.busy - tin hieu duy nhat Manager dung de biet Gemmini "xong" ==
note over Mgr_Core, G_SPAD
  io.busy := raw_cmd.valid || loop_*_unroller_busy ||
             reservation_station.io.busy || spad.module.io.busy ||
             unrolled_cmd.valid || loop_cmd.valid || conv_cmd.valid

  Day la dieu kien Manager cho (v4 buoc 5,7,8: "Cho den khi
  !io.busy(accel) && inst_q.count==0") truoc khi cho phep
  rerocc_release hoan tat hoac rerocc_fence(mUnbusy) tra sUnbusyAck.
  KHONG co bat ky per-instruction completion signal nao tu Gemmini
  ve Manager ngoai COUNTER_OP - Manager phai polling io.busy muc do
  toan-accelerator, khong biet chi tiet lenh nao xong truoc lenh nao.
end note

@enduml
